# stackguardian_stack_template_revision (Resource)

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

## Revisions

Each revision is a version of its parent
[`stackguardian_stack_template`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/StackGuardian/stackguardian/latest/docs/resources/stack_template). Create a new revision to change what a stack
deploys, rather than editing an existing one.

- `is_public` publishes the revision. Until it is published, it cannot be referenced.
- `deprecation` marks an old revision so users are steered to a newer one; set
  `deprecation.message` to say which.

## Workflow ordering

`workflows_config` holds the workflows the stack deploys, and `actions.order` expresses the
dependencies between them — this is what distinguishes a stack from a workflow group, where
workflows are independent.

